        {
            "Id": 140182008,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 140182,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 6,
            "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "嗨——，突发直播哦——。/n虽然时间不长，也请大家多关照——。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1401820060",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 200,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 2,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "403"
        },
        {
            "Id": 140182009,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 140182,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 7,
            "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "其实呢，我今天是来买泳装的。/n因为过阵子要去海边嘛。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1401820070",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 103,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 2,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "403"
        },
        {
            "Id": 140182010,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 140182,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 8,
            "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "……没错没错！和剧团电姬的大家一起。到时候应该也会直播。/n泳装挑选也有采纳我的意见，大家敬请期待！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1401820080",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 200,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 2,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 2,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "403"
        },
        {
            "Id": 140182011,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 140182,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 9,
            "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "至于是什么样的泳装……保密！等直播的时候再揭晓！/n不过我敢夸口，绝对不会辜负粉丝们的期待！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1401820090",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 17,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 2,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "403"
        },
        {
            "Id": 140182012,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 140182,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 10,
            "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "去了海边以后，我想做好多事呢。/n沙滩排球吧，打西瓜吧。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1401820100",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 102,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 7,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "403"
        },
        {
            "Id": 140182013,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 140182,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 11,
            "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "对了。那种海豚形状的泳圈之类，能租到吗？",
            "VoiceFileName": "1401820110",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 201,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 17,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "403"
        },
        {
            "Id": 140182014,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 140182,
            "Order": 2,
            "GroupOrder": 11,
            "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "我一直想坐在那上面漂在海里呢。能坐几个人来着？",
            "VoiceFileName": "1401820111",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 102,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "403"
        },
        {
            "Id": 140182015,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 140182,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 12,
            "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "还有啊，我超想在坐着的时候被人从下面掀翻。/n“扑通——”一下掉进水里，绝对超有节目效果！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1401820120",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 200,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 7,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 2,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "403"
        },
        {
            "Id": 140182016,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 140182,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 13,
            "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "还有给躺着的人往身上堆沙子的那个！绝对想玩！/n倒不如说我还想被埋一次。想试试看是不是真的动不了！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1401820130",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 101,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 2,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "403"
        },
        {
            "Id": 140182017,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 140182,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 14,
            "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "诶，我是不是兴奋过头了？啊哈哈，被你们看出来啦～？",
            "VoiceFileName": "1401820140",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 210,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 17,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 2,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "403"
        },
        {
            "Id": 140182018,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 140182,
            "Order": 2,
            "GroupOrder": 14,
            "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "因为我真的超级期待嘛！都快要做旅行手册了！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1401820141",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 101,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 2,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 2,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "403"
        },
        {
            "Id": 140182019,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 140182,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 15,
            "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "和电姬的大家一起的话，就特别值得动脑筋。/n你们看，我也算是负责直播宣传之类的嘛。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1401820150",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 103,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 7,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 2,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "403"
        },
        {
            "Id": 140182020,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 140182,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 16,
            "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "一想到要把伊吕波亲她们可爱的一面全都挖掘出来，/n平时不怎么用的脑子都要全速运转了！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1401820160",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 201,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 21,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "403"
        },
        {
            "Id": 140182021,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 140182,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 17,
            "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "那当然是精神饱满、干劲十足！敬请期待！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1401820170",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 101,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 17,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 2,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
