        {
            "Id": 140182023,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 140182,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 19,
            "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "呃——，刚说到哪儿来着？/n……对对，埋进沙子里的那个！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1401820180",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "403"
        },
        {
            "Id": 140182024,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 140182,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 20,
            "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "我要不要主动报名？还是猜拳？/n……啊哈哈！往叶羽身上堆沙子，她说不定就直接睡着了～。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1401820190",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "403"
        },
        {
            "Id": 140182025,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 140182,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 21,
            "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "对了对了，说到叶羽啊。她居然对打西瓜超级感兴趣，把我都惊到了！/n不过也能理解～。平时没机会玩嘛。我也想玩。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1401820200",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "403"
        },
        {
            "Id": 140182026,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 140182,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 22,
            "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "午饭当然要去海之家啦！/n拉面、炒面、刨冰！全都想制霸！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1401820210",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "403"
        },
        {
            "Id": 140182027,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 140182,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 23,
            "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "晚上计划吃BBQ，到时候美兔亲肯定会当总管吧。/n不是火锅奉行，而是BBQ奉行。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1401820220",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "403"
        },
        {
            "Id": 140182028,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 140182,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 24,
            "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "她好像帮忙查了不少东西。/n美兔亲做饭很好吃，好期待～。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1401820230",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "403"
        },
        {
            "Id": 140182029,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 140182,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 25,
            "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "蕾前辈？蕾前辈她……说什么夏天的海边会有黑暗组织暗中行动，/n看起来好像不是很有兴致呢。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1401820240",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "403"
        },
        {
            "Id": 140182030,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 140182,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 26,
            "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "不过没问题！我一定会把它变成开心的回忆！/n为此我还有秘密计划！哼哼哼哼哼～。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1401820250",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "403"
        },
        {
            "Id": 140182031,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 140182,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 27,
            "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "伊吕波亲也有好多想做的事，我们一直在一起商量。/n啊，电姬的练习也有好好做啦。下一场公演也干劲十足！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1401820260",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "403"
        },
        {
            "Id": 140182032,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 140182,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 28,
            "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "啊，伊吕波亲也来评论了，谢谢——。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1401820270",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "403"
        },
        {
            "Id": 140182033,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 140182,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 29,
            "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "——等等！？/n糟了，都已经过这么久了！？",
            "VoiceFileName": "1401820280",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "403"
        },
        {
            "Id": 140182034,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 140182,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 30,
            "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "抱歉，直播先到这里！大家还在等我呢！/n晚上再继续播！拜拜！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1401820290",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "403"
        },
